  3.960749588878256*^9}},
 CellID->22654314,ExpressionUUID->"4e80d788-674d-ce45-9ada-7ab1ce00de37"],

Cell["\<\
Starting from a single active cell, there are certain rules that produce \
patterns with finite lifespans, that is, their evolution is neither infinite \
nor does it die out immediately. These patterns persist for a limited number \
of time steps before becoming inactive.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.8021862859717093`*^9, 3.8021862866993*^9}, {
   3.802186780928506*^9, 3.802186861789569*^9}, {3.832335906349555*^9, 
