Cell["\<\
Rules that generate activity from an entirely inactive neighborhood (i.e., \
where the sum is zero) are considered to produce spontaneous life. These are \
discarded by checking if the transition function assigns a non-zero value to \
the lowest input sum (the last position in the rule vector).\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.8021862859717093`*^9, 3.8021862866993*^9}, {
   3.802186780928506*^9, 3.802186861789569*^9}, {3.832335906349555*^9, 
