Cell["\<\
To increase the likelihood of discovering rules that produce longer-lasting \
lifeforms, it is recommended to use a \[Lambda] increment smaller than 0.5. \
The following 3D plot shows the maximum lifetime achieved for each \
configuration. Although there are some instances where a larger increment led \
to good results, these cases are much less frequent and less probable \
overall. \
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.9610629130414658`*^9, 3.961063000940205*^9}, {
  3.961063108952935*^9, 
  3.961063197471147*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"50aa822f-b849-3343-848e-\
99dbe0b61740"],

